All 15 tests now pass. Here is what I fixed in `src/`:

- **`src/auth.py`**  
  - `has_permission`: added case-insensitive comparison (`role.lower()`).  
  - `is_admin_or_owner`: changed `and` to `or` so admin or owner alone grants access.

- **`src/inventory.py`**  
  - `__init__`: removed mutable-default bug by copying the dict (`dict(initial)`).  
  - `add`: changed overwrite to accumulation (`+=`).  
  - `reserve`: relaxed the guard from `>=` to `>` so reserving the exact available amount is allowed.  
  - `release`: added a guard so releasing more than the reserved amount raises `ValueError`.

- **`src/text_utils.py`**  
  - `slugify`: lowercased alphanumeric characters and added a `while "--" in …` loop to fully collapse repeated separators.  
  - `truncate`: ensured the suffix is counted against `max_len` (`text[:max_len - len(suffix)] + suffix`).
